          "short_first_native_line": "2025 年3月27日，本公司本次发行对应的357,085,801 股新增股份已在中国"
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 3,
          "native_characters": 688,
          "native_text_sha256": "87bd23675850cc8bde866e66eccf6c0aa22a4d24100e231fe50186861c98ebbb",
          "short_first_native_line": "（二）本次限售股份解除限售的数量和上市流通时间符合相关法律法规及限"
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 4,
          "native_characters": 30,
          "native_text_sha256": "44eb1a659bd4123b3dbd918a00db7c092e05bc8dcfefbeaa6420282c419b4eb3",
          "short_first_native_line": "深圳高速公路集团股份有限公司董事会"
        }
      ],
      "short_locator_hints": [
        {
          "physical_page": 1,
          "page_text_offset": 508,
          "snippet": " 本次股票上市流通日期为2026 年9月28 日。",
          "field_role_verified": false
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 2,
          "page_text_offset": 88,
          "snippet": "本次发行新增股份为有限售条件流通股，将于限售期届满后的次一交易日起",
          "field_role_verified": false
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 2,
          "page_text_offset": 456,
          "snippet": "本次发行完成后，公司总股本由 2,180,770,326 股增加至2,537,856,127 股。本",
          "field_role_verified": false
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 2,
          "page_text_offset": 556,
          "snippet": "三、本次限售股上市流通的有关承诺",
          "field_role_verified": false
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 2,
          "page_text_offset": 573,
          "snippet": "新通产承诺其所认购的本次发行的股票自发行结束之日起 18 个月内不得转",
          "field_role_verified": false
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 2,
          "page_text_offset": 609,
          "snippet": "让，其余发行认购对象均承诺其所认购的本次发行的股票自发行结束之日起 6 个",
          "field_role_verified": false
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 2,
          "page_text_offset": 708,
          "snippet": "承诺，不存在相关承诺未履行影响本次限售股上市流通的情况。",
          "field_role_verified": false
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 3,
          "page_text_offset": 0,
          "snippet": "（二）本次限售股份解除限售的数量和上市流通时间符合相关法律法规及限",
          "field_role_verified": false
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 3,
          "page_text_offset": 34,
          "snippet": "售承诺；",
          "field_role_verified": false
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 3,
          "page_text_offset": 67,
          "snippet": "（四）保荐人对深高速本次部分限售股份解除限售上市流通事项无异议。",
          "field_role_verified": false
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 3,
          "page_text_offset": 144,
          "snippet": "（二）本次上市流通日期为2026 年9月28 日；",
          "field_role_verified": false
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 3,
          "page_text_offset": 346,
          "snippet": "序号 限售股类型 本次上市流通数量（股）",
          "field_role_verified": false
        }
      ],
