          "snippet": " 本次股票上市流通日期为2026 年10 月8日。",
          "field_role_verified": false
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 1,
          "page_text_offset": 419,
          "snippet": "公司首次公开发行股票完成后，总股本为753,753,588 股，其中有限售条件流通股",
          "field_role_verified": false
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 1,
          "page_text_offset": 462,
          "snippet": "674,701,730 股，占公司总股本的89.51%，无限售条件流通股79,051,858 股，占公",
          "field_role_verified": false
        },
        {
          "physical_page": 1,
